Conclusion
In this lab, you architected a normalized multi-framework compliance database from scratch, engineered an ETL pipeline for heterogeneous GCC regulatory CSVs, and built a crosswalk engine linking Saudi NCA ECC, SAMA CSF, UAE NESA/SIA, and Qatar NIA to NIST SP 800-53 and ISO 27001. You implemented overlay-detection logic to surface GCC-specific requirements like data residency and Arabic logging, then produced a regional applicability matrix suitable for CGRC Domain 6 continuous monitoring reporting. These skills directly translate to real-world GRC platform design work for multinational compliance officers operating across GCC jurisdictions.
